<sect1 id="chapter8_1autotoc_md177_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter8_1autotoc_md177">
<title>Scope</title><para>This chapter explains <computeroutput>create_bundle</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>extract_bundle</computeroutput> behavior. Archives should round-trip package contents safely. Path traversal defenses are mandatory.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">bool<sp/>create_bundle(const<sp/>std::string&amp;<sp/>source_dir,<sp/>const<sp/>std::string&amp;<sp/>out_file);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">bool<sp/>extract_bundle(const<sp/>std::string&amp;<sp/>bundle_file,<sp/>const<sp/>std::string&amp;<sp/>out_dir);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<sect3 id="chapter8_1autotoc_md178">
