<sect1 id="chapter8_1autotoc_md181_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter8_1autotoc_md181">
<title>Path safety checks</title><para>Reject archive entries with <computeroutput>..</computeroutput> segments after lexical normalization. Reject absolute path entries. Create parent directories before writing extracted files.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">if<sp/>(!sattyre::extract_bundle(bundle,<sp/>out))<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>std::cerr<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>&quot;Extract<sp/>failed;<sp/>inspect<sp/>archive<sp/>for<sp/>invalid<sp/>entries\n&quot;;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
