<sect1 id="chapter8_1autotoc_md183_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter8_1autotoc_md183">
<title>Archive reproducibility</title><para>Prefer deterministic file ordering for reproducible bundles. Preserve permissions where meaningful, but never at the cost of safety. Keep archive naming and payload layout stable across builds.</para>
