<sect1 id="chapter8_1autotoc_md185_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter8_1autotoc_md185">
<title>Troubleshooting</title><para>If libarchive is unavailable, ensure fallback behavior remains explicit. Verify executable bits and text files are preserved where expected. Confirm extraction never writes outside the target tree.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>-S<sp/>.<sp/>-B<sp/>build/bundle<sp/>-DSATTYRE_ENABLE_LIBARCHIVE=ON</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>--build<sp/>build/bundle<sp/>-j</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
